    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500090/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.poster.avif?t=1736698209\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500090/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.webm?t=1736698209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500090/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.mp4?t=1736698209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This is a love game that incorporates simulated Vtuber elements. Players are required to pose with appropriate expressions to attract fans during the live broadcast. The story tells that the heroine accidentally became a Vtuber, and was recognized by her former classmate whom she had a crush on in middle school. Will she retire on the first day?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Direct control of character</h2>Players can choose whether to turn on the camera. Play as an in-game character with expression capture and facial capture, or simply use button controls.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500090/extras/e486ee9912ec4f23212a5a5e504438a7.poster.avif?t=1736698209\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500090/extras/e486ee9912ec4f23212a5a5e504438a7.webm?t=1736698209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realistic story</h2>I don\u2019t know if you have ever tried this feeling. It seems that you suddenly found that the love simulation games has lost their charm. They suddenly become unreal and difficult to fall in. This game hopes to serve this type of player and let them experience a realistic story.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500090/extras/Gif2-min.gif?t=1736698209\" /></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500090/extras/8ff595e8bc3fc5847d193cb48c911c88.poster.avif?t=1736698209\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500090/extras/8ff595e8bc3fc5847d193cb48c911c88.webm?t=1736698209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500090/extras/8ff595e8bc3fc5847d193cb48c911c88.mp4?t=1736698209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500090/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.poster.avif?t=1736698209\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500090/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.webm?t=1736698209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2500090/extras/f6827864544739152ba8aa2c087ae123.mp4?t=1736698209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
